#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:5
#: 3b1296dd0d6e4dffbef91adc0102bcf6 5f46439f1bf048df93875dcccc83ac09
#: f1dbbc850d214c9f822be5d1e1bbf83d
msgid "LIDAR-Lite Rangefinder"
msgstr "LIDAR-Lite 测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:7
#: 45ab1c305b2d45f39fbc6331926e30bf 9983c1764a2f484aac0cf4a4b35c5fbe
#: e8400919ef2b4b968e312abc389b394c
msgid ""
"The `Garmin / PulsedLight LIDAR-Lite "
"<https://support.garmin.com/support/manuals/manuals.htm?partNo=010-01722-00>`__"
" rangefinder is a low-cost optical distance measurement solution with a 40m "
"range under most operating conditions, low power consumption, and small form"
" factor.  This sensor can be purchased from many online retailers including "
"`Sparkfun <https://www.sparkfun.com/products/14032>`__.  Technical info can "
"be found `here "
"<https://support.garmin.com/support/manuals/manuals.htm?partNo=010-01722-00>`__."
msgstr ""
"`Garmin / PulsedLight LIDAR-Lite "
"<https://support.garmin.com/support/manuals/manuals.htm?partNo=010-01722-00>`__"
" 测距仪是一款低成本光学测距解决方案，在大多数工作条件下量程可达 40m，功耗低且体积小巧。该传感器可从多家在线零售商购买，包括 `Sparkfun "
"<https://www.sparkfun.com/products/14032>`__。技术资料可在 `此处 "
"<https://support.garmin.com/support/manuals/manuals.htm?partNo=010-01722-00>`__"
" 获取。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:13
#: aed1a9eb174b4f319307af27405b3db3 d4f90bc6e0e9439986b649a2505d9348
#: f0a40d854f0b432facd3c5110e46143e
msgid "Problems with the Lidar-Lite v1 & v2"
msgstr "Lidar-Lite v1 和 v2 的问题"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:15
#: 19e0f548024240e2a369c18ee7706d13 558391341fd3403f818e5ec9d735091b
#: c9d225edd5a04ed48d499f26bf00bd7c
msgid ""
"A number of problems have been found with the Lidar-Lite v1 & v2 and it is "
"not yet clear if these issues are resolved in v3. Attempts to resolve these "
"issues with the manufacture have not been entirely successful. These notes "
"serve as a warning to potential users."
msgstr ""
"Lidar-Lite v1 和 v2 存在若干已知问题，目前尚不清楚这些问题在 v3 "
"中是否已解决。与制造商协商解决这些问题的尝试未能完全成功。以下说明旨在警示潜在用户。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:17
#: b2a55b3402d64e71bb150d8913631c28 c9f9c530240e4b9ab32ec264c4a46b2e
#: d9fc2a20192049f6ac7624a1ff6ca599
msgid "The problems are:"
msgstr "问题如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:19
#: 7f5e8143971447798131bc0c6ace231a 8454c4526ef44eda9113465c274f7bef
#: ac988e8ed54243f0a52cfa15071042dd
msgid ""
"13m offset from true distance on both \"blue-label\" and \"black-label\" "
"Lidars"
msgstr "「蓝标」和「黑标」激光雷达与真实距离存在 13m 偏差"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:20
#: 3b40d6d81c69421781a4c512b1cd7171 9cef1e7868424d89bd267ad76aab02ba
#: e143186464f14b9aba39bfa47b146c60
msgid "Interference with other I2C devices when using \"blue-label\" Lidars"
msgstr "「蓝标」激光雷达与同一 I2C 总线上其他 I2C 设备产生干扰"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:21
#: 39facb59716f474e86cdb2e6fef5c49a e8be38c3065d4d6498876c9a48b37eb3
#: efd1c62edfc2405bb60c1544fa5fd66b
msgid "Sensor lock-ups when using I2C with the older \"black-label\" Lidars"
msgstr "使用 I2C 连接较旧「黑标」激光雷达时出现传感器死锁"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:22
#: 438b4f4e8a80453d8bd7a786382ac4e5 85b60c691988412b942cb01cdcb35257
#: d39c312eb5f242c7a0fde05509faffbf
msgid "GPS interference with the older \"black-label\" Lidars"
msgstr "较旧「黑标」激光雷达对 GPS 产生干扰"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:25
#: 1215bcb9379e4ef4b88bf0595477de5d 94923e006abc46f68155ba903784b301
#: cdf13a7d38fb4a9181fb619617f636a7
msgid "13m offset (Blue-Label and Black-Label Lidars)"
msgstr "13m 偏差（蓝标和黑标激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:27
#: 074f8eea40ab4485bb28faa22eaa4ce4 775b0d86aeb746c5ae114cc790c0c248
#: f4aa68309fae41158fcdfbbd3ed228d9
msgid ""
"The lidar will sometimes (rarely) return a distance of approximately 13m "
"greater than the true distance. This happens on both I2C and PWM. The "
"problem has been recorded in several flight logs on several different "
"aircraft and has also been reproduced in extensive bench testing."
msgstr ""
"激光雷达有时（极少）会返回比真实距离大约多 13m 的数值。此问题在 I2C 和 PWM "
"接口下均可出现。该问题已记录在多架飞机的多份飞行日志中，且在大量台架测试中也已复现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:29
#: 141604ac06714f54b2efa735d0ac931e 17fc9170ee3a428e915edda32c51f6d2
#: 40322b9ed49b4d4db39047fb79d39788
msgid ""
"When the problem happens the 13m offset usually locks in place, so all "
"remaining readings from the Lidar for the rest of the flight will give a 13m"
" offset. There have however been cases where the 13m offset disappears after"
" a few seconds or minutes."
msgstr ""
"问题发生时，13m 偏差通常会固定下来，此后飞行过程中激光雷达的所有读数都将带有 13m 偏差。但也有少数情况下，该偏差会在几秒或几分钟后消失。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:31
#: 7296a8d5ea884ac88dac9d648faef443 9a0dc5193ec64d3a841324e39a78d4a5
#: b0363dc1f58c49fabe1cef07129d7820
msgid ""
"The problem is much more likely to occur if the Lidar power supply "
"fluctuates too much. The problem can be easily reproduced in a bench setup "
"where the Lidar is initially powered at below 4V then the voltage raised."
msgstr "当激光雷达供电电压波动过大时，该问题更容易出现。在台架测试中，只需先以低于 4V 为激光雷达供电再升压，即可轻松复现此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:33
#: 2428c3cd3ce8479d8d06cfa34a65101e 28c19695949d475aa0bd72ab554955ff
#: e5c06b595dd7455dada3bf5d460ca1d4
msgid ""
"Unfortunately low supply voltage is not the only trigger for the problem, so"
" ensuring a good power supply will reduce the probability of the issue but "
"not eliminate it. Multiple flight logs where the supply voltage to the Lidar"
" is being monitored show the problem can occur with a good power supply."
msgstr ""
"遗憾的是，电压偏低并非触发该问题的唯一原因，因此确保良好的供电只能降低问题发生概率，无法完全消除。多份监测激光雷达供电电压的飞行日志显示，即使供电良好，该问题依然可能出现。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:35
#: 25bbee97dd6a45b6938d50dd3222a170 40cc31f9b871425c82a062cb837e4dac
#: 44a74db2861343b0acfe2d848ca1f755
msgid ""
"There is no known workaround for this issue. Detailed traces of the issue "
"have been provided to the makers of the device with no resolution. The issue"
" has also been reproduced using the device makers own software and own "
"recommended hardware setup."
msgstr "目前该问题没有已知的解决方案。已向设备制造商提供详细的问题追踪记录，但未获得解决。使用制造商自己的软件和推荐硬件配置同样可以复现该问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:38
#: 2f4225fe009a48d49667a75346c5b289 490a75d8d8f04df1a3650dd27e93ac2b
#: dd7ffd457ac7430c8dffa40fdce77eec
msgid "I2C interference (Blue-Label Lidars)"
msgstr "I2C 干扰（蓝标激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:40
#: 8b5de12426054108a87e43cc3f2db9ce a85b78f3127f4d359ee9893ee55db950
#: eead360e9fd542ab9d499d5947537cc3
msgid ""
"The newer blue-label Lidars have been associated with interference problems "
"on I2C with other I2C devices on the same bus. In particular, incorrect "
"airspeed readings have been seen when used on the same I2C bus as a digital "
"airspeed sensor. This issue does not occur in all aircraft, but when it does"
" occur the results are quite dramatic, with airspeed readings being off by "
"more than 10m/s."
msgstr ""
"较新的蓝标激光雷达与同一 I2C 总线上的其他 I2C 设备存在干扰问题。特别是与数字空速传感器共用同一 I2C "
"总线时，会出现空速读数错误的情况。此问题并不在所有飞机上出现，但一旦发生，影响相当明显，空速读数误差可超过 10m/s。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:42
#: 7df6c1f9018b4de3960b8f6b9295d5ed 984faffd74974688a9f774a985a1dfeb
#: 998c587d8a2b4f4fa418ff478cfa415f
msgid ""
"Although bench testing has reproduced the result we have not yet managed to "
"capture a logic trace of it happening. The problem is solved by using the "
"Lidar via PWM instead of I2C."
msgstr "尽管台架测试已复现该结果，但尚未捕获到问题发生时的逻辑追踪。改用 PWM 而非 I2C 连接激光雷达可解决此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:45
#: 3c6386f2315e46e5865995fee01b34bc 48d677475772421faa400ea5920b7489
#: bb7d6d9e083c40ebb8e52f4d6dae23e5
msgid "Sensor Lock-up on I2C (Black-Label Lidar)"
msgstr "I2C 传感器死锁（黑标激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:47
#: 46bbe3875ac3450988d43090097ca8bd 82eec4f911d94da8960f6caf6a86b016
#: fc77c9914c3e491dab20f5af24e3847d
msgid ""
"The first issue (Lock-ups on I2C with black-label lidars) is solved by "
"either using the new blue-label Lidars or by using the PWM output method, "
"preferably with a reset pin. The issue is not common, but it is relatively "
"easy to reproduce in bench tests by covering the Lidars lenses. It appears "
"to be more likely to happen when the Lidar is reading short distances. There"
" are two manifestations of the issue - one is where the lock-up is solved by"
" sending a I2C reset command, the other does not respond to an I2C reset."
msgstr ""
"第一个问题（黑标激光雷达 I2C 死锁）可通过改用新款蓝标激光雷达或 PWM "
"输出方式（最好配合复位引脚）来解决。该问题不常见，但在台架测试中通过遮住激光雷达镜头可较容易地复现。问题似乎在激光雷达测量近距离时更易发生。该问题有两种表现形式：一种可通过发送"
" I2C 复位命令解除死锁，另一种则对 I2C 复位无响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:50
#: a159b18e704f4cb2b7496dcf72ae918e e8deaa80837743fa890b67e64e0f4895
#: fab18750f2af489380dc85871ea46acf
msgid "GPS Interference (Black-Label Lidars)"
msgstr "GPS 干扰（黑标激光雷达）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:52
#: 297f549af3004f128c6e0188ee8e22b4 74a0b843a25348829274c23dc9d76cd3
#: b077cd2cfe144305ad2998c77db23ba2
msgid ""
"The older black-label Lidars cause significant GPS interference. This "
"manifests as longer time to get GPS lock on power up and higher levels of "
"GPS noise when lock is achieved resulting in lower GPS accuracy. Testing "
"shows that the interference includes both a conducted and radiated "
"component."
msgstr ""
"较旧的黑标激光雷达会对 GPS 产生严重干扰，表现为上电后 GPS 锁定时间变长，以及锁定后 GPS "
"噪声增大导致定位精度下降。测试表明，干扰同时包含传导和辐射两种成分。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:54
#: 0b5cf72ac73b470692dd9e738c7d63c4 152f26a5d2d24ea897d58e859934e705
#: e2eb412b4e7b477cb71e36208a7acddf
msgid ""
"Placing the Lidar as far away from the GPS as possible helps, but does not "
"entirely eliminate the issue."
msgstr "将激光雷达尽量远离 GPS 有所帮助，但无法完全消除干扰。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:57
#: 45ebe33846304e44bd90818f77f7eaa8 66cf18a7277347cf855dddf5f5837660
#: dab19a32b0154d57b441cb1fc9459fa0
msgid "Connecting via I2C"
msgstr "通过 I2C 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:61
#: 33ac0e26694346d6897e39bf83f89c72 3de199589ab04627b82a9704b1e69475
#: a408a42629f44f9b8410ec539917bfb3
msgid ""
"Lidar-Lites manufactured before Feb 2015 have I2C interface communications "
"issues.  For these lidar please connect using PWM."
msgstr "2015 年 2 月之前生产的 Lidar-Lite 存在 I2C 通信问题。此类激光雷达请改用 PWM 连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:63
#: 0e139cdd7ce8452d8210b4188f09d465 8ba2e0b18ee747c6829db8229619f9d2
#: 90cbc2d74aa64ad7a735549b5963f7b0
msgid ""
"The connector cable has a 6-pin CLIK Mate connector on one end and tinned "
"leads on the other.  The leads should be soldered to a DF13 or JST connector"
" and connected to the autopilot's I2C port as shown below"
msgstr ""
"连接线缆一端为 6 针 CLIK Mate 连接器，另一端为镀锡导线。导线应焊接至 DF13 或 JST 连接器，并按下图所示连接至飞控的 I2C "
"接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:65
#: 044981de148944eda443a58be428430d 070e89477132463881218e4c94858cb9
#: 98d236e974044521b0a4a6266475a7eb
msgid ""
"The power to the rangefinder should be supplied from a separate external BEC"
" as shown in the diagram below."
msgstr "测距仪的电源应由独立的外部 BEC 提供，如下图所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:110
#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:71
#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:89
#: 2e6f0de9910d47a992c8812eb246812a 3e01da11aef44396abb6ec3d9da65077
#: 7e72873583484b6fb7fbc90284f29d0a b0ecc8d26d8049c4b03fb338f8b227eb
#: b63e060beb854ee29e5715c7db94acab cb5666f8f518474396eb7b4003176b43
#: cc97f2680d584b1f80ab8d70b057a279 d5d759d98ca8406381ad18bc0c1fc5cc
#: ecb1aa7f372842b1a696841a33f904a0
msgid "Set the following parameters:"
msgstr "设置以下参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:73
#: 35096b5233c042eca316eb4ca77045db 5d8295efe6ef49f49baee90136a4dca4
#: a1aa142ac18e4d95a8687724314ad046
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 3 \"LidarLite-I2c\""
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 3 「LidarLite-I2c」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:74
#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:93
#: 6164373cb85a44ac88810cefbdfb3e90 924719b0282347dc8efd02c6d2ae67f6
#: a12176f1bd584b58aaeb27162cc34331 a52afc1ced0c4ec3bd5f1673ffc5e267
#: c9474e3082bf40e18d4d1cddc7e3e989 edbeb15eac4d446185f7bb2b7f15c69c
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 35 (the maximum range the lidar can "
"accurately report in m)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 35（激光雷达能准确报告的最大量程，单位 m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:75
#: a593e1c936004275b5ef95966b8b976c adf6786ce51d483c9aa45ba493fc639e
#: df9fde8b04194b4cb7c5ba62e1414082
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.20 (the mininum range the lidar can "
"accurately report in m)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.20（激光雷达能准确报告的最小量程，单位 m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:78
#: 3374695dffda443793f9682403b57654 39e50658f6b147fd8b668439b8e37742
#: 4b4de2b65a88455e8668e31ccfdf5408
msgid "Connecting via PWM"
msgstr "通过 PWM 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:80
#: 4d09ca6c6b5f4e7a83ef1d935100d089 56c7ed26f4a041da98923ac47cb6f083
#: 672b770cc0fa423d9029928b61eae4d9
msgid ""
"The PWM interface is recommended because it avoids a number of issues with "
"the I2C interface."
msgstr "推荐使用 PWM 接口，可规避 I2C 接口的诸多问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:82
#: 1645009863c741df86388b78a0784ce7 c62896d741f948a49adc30c81dc90152
#: d48885fcb3dd4e7dbf2612d136b6d477
msgid ""
"Connect the Lidar to the rear servo rail of the autopilot and BEC or ESC (to"
" provide power) as shown below:"
msgstr "将激光雷达连接至飞控后部舵机排针，并连接 BEC 或 ESC 供电，如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:87
#: 384b24c8f3724114b577a2a937cfcf68 bec995bee7e3423ba091f2db8987b745
#: e522d39d37594928a083c797f743db5c
msgid ""
"The resistor can be between 200 Ohm and 1kOhm.  Connecting a resistor "
"between the Mode-control pin (number \"5\") and ground (number \"3\") puts "
"the Lidar into continuous acquisition mode."
msgstr "电阻阻值可在 200 Ω 至 1kΩ 之间。将电阻连接于模式控制引脚（编号「5」）与地（编号「3」）之间，可使激光雷达进入连续采集模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:91
#: 71aabde1e26149e099c91f7c1722d250 9917c55486704e8ebc93e1c1248e8606
#: f9be0758431647499c0a1fb85b39a12b
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 5 \"PWM\""
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE <RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 5 「PWM」"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:92
#: 833ecc42c68d447cbd47debe1bfc7e78 a7c16ec132c241f48e4c2fa0d8d20968
#: da32ee8670004ca5abd1914417069284
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_PIN <RNGFND1_PIN>` = 54 \"AUX5\" (if using 4.0.0 or higher any"
" Auxiliary output may be used)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_PIN <RNGFND1_PIN>` = 54 「AUX5」（如使用 4.0.0 或更高版本，任意辅助输出均可使用）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:94
#: 5785d49b574f40878d66c7d6dd57fef7 ae666508491e45dfbff1fc17711d0c09
#: c23c988f18164ce89fcbb9d17b007326
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.2 (the mininum range the lidar can "
"accurately report in m)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN <RNGFND1_MIN>` = 0.2（激光雷达能准确报告的最小量程，单位 m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:95
