#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:105
#: 37863aa4d2ed4e048c9c36a548c7ceee 7c92e684712b42d6b4e17419989fad28
#: 9c85711865db42cfb90fc5d8bbc93e98
msgid ""
"When using the PWM driver you can optionally configure the lidar to be "
"disabled when the vehicle is more than a specified height above the terrain "
"(using SRTM altitudes) saving about 100mA of current."
msgstr "使用 PWM 驱动时，可选择在飞行器高于指定地形高度（使用 SRTM 高程）时禁用激光雷达，节省约 100mA 电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:112
#: 81d54d63ee1c43d998062e1ff9772c3f 8b19a6e2aa56409ca6afe7060214f558
#: bf8bee6310b24915a57845940925b8d8
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_STOP_PIN <RNGFND1_STOP_PIN>` to 55 \"AUX6\" (other auxiliary "
"pins may also be used)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_STOP_PIN <RNGFND1_STOP_PIN>` 设置为 55 「AUX6」（也可使用其他辅助引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:113
#: 08d3ee8d48f64ccdb969d55c912586aa cf1bd9a9d72a4c21bd01651c42b070f8
#: f2d4534e838f49b7825f2980319ff665
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_PWRRNG <RNGFND1_PWRRNG>` to a terrain height in meters above "
"which the Lidar will be disabled to save power"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_PWRRNG <RNGFND1_PWRRNG>` 设置为地形高度（米），超过该高度后激光雷达将被禁用以节省电量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:115
#: 6c75cabd00824d768b0d9c6a375eb0f1 70d4c18d8ae44109ac6f2b5a0a97ba23
#: 8735eaa8ba2d42d2ab3054e80bf62f50
msgid ""
"When the terrain data indicates that the vehicle is above the "
":ref:`RNGFND1_PWRRNG <RNGFND1_PWRRNG>` height the :ref:`RNGFND1_STOP_PIN "
"<RNGFND1_STOP_PIN>` will be used to disable the Lidar"
msgstr ""
"当地形数据显示飞行器高于 :ref:`RNGFND1_PWRRNG <RNGFND1_PWRRNG>` "
"设定高度时，:ref:`RNGFND1_STOP_PIN <RNGFND1_STOP_PIN>` 将用于禁用激光雷达"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-lidarlite.rst:118
